✅ **Individual Student:** "I'm studying for NREMT-Paramedic, using EMSTrainer to practice scenarios"

✅ **Instructor:** "I teach at a community college and use EMSTrainer in my EMS class"

✅ **Volunteer Department:** "Our 5-person volunteer fire department uses it for training"

✅ **Study Group:** "My paramedic cohort shares it for test prep"

✅ **Internal Use:** "Our hospital uses it to train our EMS continuing education"

