## Commercial License Required Examples

❌ **Training Company:** "We sell EMS certification courses and want to include EMSTrainer"

❌ **SaaS Platform:** "We're building MedicTrainer.com using EMSTrainer code"

❌ **Paid Program:** "Our for-profit EMS academy wants to use this for students"

