## Contributing

Contributions are welcome! By contributing to EMSTrainer, you agree that:

1. Your contributions will be licensed under the same AGPL v3.0 + Commons Clause license
2. You have the right to contribute the code (it's your original work or properly licensed)
3. You understand the mission of keeping EMSTrainer free for students

**How to contribute:**
- Fork the repository
- Make improvements
- Submit pull request with clear description
- Include tests if applicable
- Maintain medical accuracy

