## Enforcement

Violations of this license (unauthorized commercial use, failure to share source code of modified networked versions, etc.) may result in:

1. Takedown requests
2. License revocation
3. Legal action if necessary

We prefer to work with organizations to find appropriate licensing arrangements. If you're unsure whether your use requires a commercial license, please ask.

